<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Hyegong of Silla</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 780</span> · <a href="/centuries/8th-century">8th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Hyegong was king of Silla from 765 to 780, coming to the throne as a child. His reign saw repeated revolts by noble factions, and he was killed in a rebellion in 780. As the last king descended from King Muyeol, his death opened a long period of violent succession struggles that weakened Unified Silla.</p></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>Silla's decline began after the reign of King <b>Hyegong</b>, who was killed in 780 during an aristocratic revolt.</blockquote><a href="/empire/silla">Silla · Decline &amp; Fall</a></li></ul></section>
